            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Plaintiffs allege that Goldman Sachs maintained an artificially inflated stock price by repeatedly making false and misleading generic statements about its ability to manage conflicts."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Background and Question",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
